{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the captivating story of the Aztecs and their intricate relationships with the gods, develop trade, build a city, and try to teach the Aztec god Huitzilopochtli to embrace veganism!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, we\u2019ve introduced changes to Match-3 gameplay and revamped the logic behind mahjong layout designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features numerous Match-3 levels with diverse mechanics, as well as bonus games that are completely skippable\u2014you can play them after finishing the main game or skip them altogether. Additionally, you\u2019ll need to build a brand-new city.<br>- 90 new replayable Match 3 levels ( relaxed/limited moves/timed )<br>- 8 skippable tricky Spot The Difference scenes<br>- 20 skippable Mahjong games<br>- 20 skippable Block games<br>- hidden treasures<br>And a story and the town to build!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3487940?t=1739956091","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3487940?t=1739956091","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487940/fa8dea4eda09913e6cd06a1977cc0d6e0bd7615f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739956091","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487940/fa8dea4eda09913e6cd06a1977cc0d6e0bd7615f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739956091","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the captivating story of the Aztecs and their intricate relationships with the gods, develop trade, build a city, and try to teach the Aztec god Huitzilopochtli to embrace veganism!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, we\u2019ve introduced changes to Match-3 gameplay and revamped the logic behind mahjong